                                                "sense_id": "5678e9de-a8c2-372b-9f5a-6b9d850714eb",
                                                "text": "The template was repiloted by the same four surgeons and recovery ward nurses to see if opinions and the usability of the template had improved, with the eventual aim of computerising the template."
